{"name":"BooleanAnalysis.walsh_expansion","v":1,"source_hash":"653ff0ac67cd7813","lines":["n : ℕ","f : BooleanFunc n","x : BoolCube n","⊢ f x = ∑ S, fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x","⊢ f x = ∑ x_1, (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, f x * chiS x_1 x) * chiS x_1 x","⊢ ∑ x_1, (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, f x * chiS x_1 x) * chiS x_1 x = f x","⊢ ∑ S, (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS S y) * chiS S x = 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, ∑ S, f y * (chiS S y * chiS S x)","step1 : ∑ S, (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS S y) * chiS S x = 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ S, (∑ y, f y * chiS S y) * chiS S x","⊢ ∑ S, (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS S y) * chiS S x = 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ S, (∑ y, f y * chiS S y) * chiS S x","⊢ ∑ S, (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS S y) * chiS S x = ∑ i, 2⁻¹ ^ n * ((∑ y, f y * chiS i y) * chiS i x)","⊢ ∀ x_1 ∈ Finset.univ, (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS x_1 y) * chiS x_1 x = 2⁻¹ ^ n * ((∑ y, f y * chiS x_1 y) * chiS x_1 x)","S : Finset (Fin n)","a✝ : S ∈ Finset.univ","⊢ (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS S y) * chiS S x = 2⁻¹ ^ n * ((∑ y, f y * chiS S y) * chiS S x)","⊢ S ∈ Finset.univ → (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * chiS S y) * chiS S x = 2⁻¹ ^ n * ((∑ y, f y * chiS S y) * chiS S x)","step2 : ∑ S, (∑ y, f y * chiS S y) * chiS S x = ∑ y, ∑ S, f y * (chiS S y * chiS S x)","⊢ ∑ S, (∑ y, f y * chiS S y) * chiS S x = ∑ y, ∑ S, f y * (chiS S y * chiS S x)","⊢ ∑ x_1, ∑ i, f i * chiS x_1 i * chiS x_1 x = ∑ y, ∑ S, f y * (chiS S y * chiS S x)","⊢ ∑ y, ∑ x_1, f y * chiS x_1 y * chiS x_1 x = ∑ y, ∑ S, f y * (chiS S y * chiS S x)","⊢ ∀ x_1 ∈ Finset.univ, ∑ x_2, f x_1 * chiS x_2 x_1 * chiS x_2 x = ∑ S, f x_1 * (chiS S x_1 * chiS S x)","y : BoolCube n","a✝ : y ∈ Finset.univ","⊢ ∑ x_1, f y * chiS x_1 y * chiS x_1 x = ∑ S, f y * (chiS S y * chiS S x)","⊢ y ∈ Finset.univ → ∑ x_1, f y * chiS x_1 y * chiS x_1 x = ∑ S, f y * (chiS S y * chiS S x)","⊢ ∀ x_1 ∈ Finset.univ, f y * chiS x_1 y * chiS x_1 x = f y * (chiS x_1 y * chiS x_1 x)","a✝¹ : y ∈ Finset.univ","⊢ f y * chiS S y * chiS S x = f y * (chiS S y * chiS S x)","⊢ S ∈ Finset.univ → f y * chiS S y * chiS S x = f y * (chiS S y * chiS S x)","⊢ 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, ∑ S, f y * (chiS S y * chiS S x) = 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * ∑ S, chiS S y * chiS S x","case e_a","⊢ ∑ y, ∑ S, f y * (chiS S y * chiS S x) = ∑ y, f y * ∑ S, chiS S y * chiS S x","⊢ ∀ x_1 ∈ Finset.univ, ∑ S, f x_1 * (chiS S x_1 * chiS S x) = f x_1 * ∑ S, chiS S x_1 * chiS S x","x y : BoolCube n","⊢ ∑ S, f y * (chiS S y * chiS S x) = f y * ∑ S, chiS S y * chiS S x","⊢ y ∈ Finset.univ → ∑ S, f y * (chiS S y * chiS S x) = f y * ∑ S, chiS S y * chiS S x","⊢ 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * ∑ S, chiS S y * chiS S x = 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * if y = x then 2 ^ n else 0","⊢ (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ y, f y * if y = x then 2 ^ n else 0) = 2⁻¹ ^ n * (f x * 2 ^ n)","⊢ (∑ y, f y * if y = x then 2 ^ n else 0) = f x * 2 ^ n","⊢ 2⁻¹ ^ n * (f x * 2 ^ n) = f x","⊢ 2 ≠ 0"],"goals":[[0,1,2,3],[0,1,2,4],[0,1,2,5],[0,1,2,6],[0,1,2,7,6],[0,1,2,8],[0,1,2,9],[0,1,2,10],[0,1,2,11,12,13],[0,1,2,11,14],[0,1,2,7,15,6],[0,1,2,7,16],[0,1,2,7,17],[0,1,2,7,18],[0,1,2,7,19],[0,1,2,7,20,21,22],[0,1,2,7,20,23],[0,1,2,7,20,21,24],[0,1,2,7,20,25,11,12,26],[0,1,2,7,20,21,11,27],[0,1,2,28],[29,0,1,2,30],[29,0,1,2,31],[29,0,1,32,21,33],[29,0,1,32,34],[0,1,2,35],[0,1,2,36],[29,0,1,2,37],[0,1,2,38],[0,1,2,39]],"steps":[{"line":7,"col":2,"end_line":7,"end_col":63,"tactic":"simp only [fourierCoeff, innerProduct, expect, uniformWeight]\n  -- Goal: f x = ∑_S (2⁻ⁿ * ∑_y f(y) * χ_S(y)) * χ_S(x)\n    -- Proof: show both sides equal 2⁻ⁿ * ∑_y f(y) * ∑_S χ_S(y) * χ_S(x)\n    --        then use the completeness kernel","before":[0],"after":[1],"used":["Finset.fintype","Eq.mpr","Real","BooleanAnalysis.BoolCube","Bool.fintype","HMul.hMul","Finset.univ","congrArg","Real.instInv","Finset","instDecidableEqFin","Pi.instFintype","Membership.mem","id","NPow.toPow","Fin.fintype","Real.instMonoid","Inv.inv","HPow.hPow","BooleanAnalysis.fourierCoeff","Finset.instSetLike","Nat","Real.instMul","Bool"]},{"line":11,"col":2,"end_line":11,"end_col":6,"tactic":"symm","before":[1],"after":[2],"used":["Finset.fintype","Real","BooleanAnalysis.BoolCub